# DSSAT outputs (VERY IMPORTANT)
# ===============================
*.OUT
*.out
*.OSU
*.SUM
*.WTH
*.SOL
*.X??
*.csv

PlantGro.OUT
SoilWat.OUT
Summary.OUT
Evaluate.OUT

